ShortDescription: Catches nail biting, mustache and hair pulling and face touching through your webcam and nudges you to stop.
Description: |-
  Habit Guard watches your webcam for a hand going to your mouth, mustache, brows or hair and
  interrupts the habit within about a second with a sound, a dimmed screen, a spoken phrase or a
  notification. It runs entirely on your computer, uses a fraction of a percent of the CPU, never
  saves a picture and has no networking code. Zones can be adjusted, and your own can be drawn for
  habits that are not on the list.
